# Savory Tofu Scramble

Based on [Minimalist Baker](https://minimalistbaker.com/southwest-tofu-scramble) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251031171305/https://minimalistbaker.com/southwest-tofu-scramble/)), [Brit’s Bites](https://britsbites.com/vegan-asian-inspired-tofu-scramble-recipe) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250814050906/https://britsbites.com/vegan-asian-inspired-tofu-scramble-recipe/)), and [Walder Wellness](https://www.walderwellness.com/easy-curry-tofu-scramble-vegan) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251118105503/https://www.walderwellness.com/easy-curry-tofu-scramble-vegan/))

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Base

- [ ] 1 (14- to 16-ounce) block [firm or extra-firm tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" }, drained
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" } or neutral oil
- [ ] [Salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }

### Mexican Sauce

- [ ] 2 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [chili powder]{ ing="chili-powder" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon paprika]{ ing="teaspoon-paprika" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon turmeric]{ ing="teaspoon-turmeric" } (for color)
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [nutritional yeast]{ ing="nutritional-yeast" } (optional)
- [ ] 2-3 tablespoons [water or vegetable broth]{ ing="water-or-vegetable-broth" }

### Asian Sauce

- [ ] 2 tablespoons [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } or liquid aminos
- [ ] 1 tablespoon [rice vinegar]{ ing="rice-vinegar" }
- [ ] 1 tablespoon fresh [ginger]{ ing="ginger" }, grated
- [ ] 2 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [sesame oil]{ ing="sesame-oil" }
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [water]{ ing="water" }

### Curry Sauce

- [ ] 2 tablespoons [soy sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } or coconut aminos
- [ ] 2 teaspoons [curry powder]{ ing="curry-powder" }
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [maple syrup]{ ing="maple-syrup" } or honey
- [ ] [½ teaspoon turmeric]{ ing="teaspoon-turmeric" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon cumin]{ ing="teaspoon-cumin" }
- [ ] 2 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2-3 tablespoons [coconut milk]{ ing="coconut-milk" } or water

### Classic Diner Sauce (with eggs)

- [ ] 2 [eggs]{ ing="egg" }, lightly beaten
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [nutritional yeast]{ ing="nutritional-yeast" }
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [garlic powder]{ ing="garlic-powder" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon onion powder]{ ing="teaspoon-onion-powder" }
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 1 tablespoon fresh [chives or scallions]{ ing="chives-or-scallions" }, chopped
- [ ] [Salt]{ ing="salt" } to taste
- [ ] Optional: 2 tablespoons [shredded cheddar cheese]{ ing="shredded-cheddar-cheese" }

### Veggie Western Sauce

- [ ] [½ cup bell peppers]{ ing="cup-bell-peppers" } (red/green mix), diced
- [ ] [¼ cup onion]{ ing="cup-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 2 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] [½ cup cherry tomatoes]{ ing="cup-cherry-tomatoes" }, halved
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [smoked paprika]{ ing="smoked-paprika" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon dried oregano]{ ing="teaspoon-dried-oregano" }
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [nutritional yeast]{ ing="nutritional-yeast" }
- [ ] [Salt]{ ing="salt" } to taste
- [ ] Optional: ¼ cup [shredded cheese]{ ing="shredded-cheese" }

### Everything Bagel Sauce

- [ ] 2 tablespoons [everything bagel seasoning]{ ing="everything-bagel-seasoning" }
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [vegan cream cheese]{ ing="vegan-cream-cheese" } (or regular cream cheese)
- [ ] 2 [scallions]{ ing="scallions" }, chopped
- [ ] 1 tablespoon [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2 tablespoons [unsweetened plant-based milk]{ ing="unsweetened-plant-based-milk" } or water

### Loaded Cheesy Herb Sauce

- [ ] 3 tablespoons [nutritional yeast]{ ing="nutritional-yeast" }
- [ ] 2 [garlic cloves]{ ing="garlic-cloves" }, minced
- [ ] 2 tablespoons fresh [herbs]{ ing="herbs" } (chives, parsley, or dill), chopped
- [ ] 1 tablespoon [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [Dijon mustard]{ ing="dijon-mustard" }
- [ ] [½ teaspoon garlic powder]{ ing="teaspoon-garlic-powder" }
- [ ] [¼ teaspoon black pepper]{ ing="teaspoon-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 2-3 tablespoons [unsweetened plant-based milk]{ ing="unsweetened-plant-based-milk" } or water
- [ ] Optional: 2 tablespoons [vegan cream cheese]{ ing="vegan-cream-cheese" }

## Recipe

1. Set the [tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" } on one of its large flat sides and cut it in half horizontally. Pat dry and wrap in towels. If time allows, press the tofu by placing a cast-iron skillet or other heavy object on top of the wrapped tofu for about 30 minutes.
1. Choose your [sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } variation and mix all sauce ingredients together in a small bowl. Set aside. **Note:** For Veggie Western sauce, keep vegetables separate. For Classic Diner sauce, keep [eggs]{ ing="egg" } separate.
1. Unwrap the [tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" } and season all sides with [salt and pepper]{ ing="salt-and-pepper" }. Heat the [oil]{ ing="sesame-oil" } in a medium skillet over medium-high. Add the tofu and cook until golden brown and crisp, 3 to 6 minutes per side.
1. **For Veggie Western only:** Remove [tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" } temporarily. Add diced [bell peppers]{ ing="cup-bell-peppers" } and [onions]{ ing="cup-onion" } to the pan, cook 3-4 minutes until softened. Add garlic and [tomatoes]{ ing="cup-cherry-tomatoes" }, cook 1 minute more. Return tofu to pan.
1. Reduce heat to medium. Using a spatula or wooden spoon, break up the [tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" } into chunks. Add your prepared [sauce]{ ing="soy-sauce" } and cook, stirring and continuing to break up the tofu, until the sauce is absorbed and the tofu is golden brown, 2 to 4 minutes.
1. **For Classic Diner only:** Push [tofu]{ ing="firm-or-extra-firm-tofu" } to sides of pan, add beaten [eggs]{ ing="egg" } to center, scramble until just set, then fold together with tofu.
1. Taste and adjust [seasoning]{ ing="everything-bagel-seasoning" }.

## Notes

- Add quick-cooking vegetables (spinach, kale, bell peppers, green onions) along with the sauce. Increase seasoning if adding vegetables.

### Serving Suggestions by Variation

**Mexican version:**

- Black beans (see [Instant Pot beans](../sides/no_soak_instant_pot_beans.html))
- Sliced avocado
- Pico de gallo (diced tomato, onion, jalapeño, cilantro, lime juice, salt)
- Salsa
- Charred corn (pan-fry kernels in dry skillet until spotted)
- Fresh cilantro
- Lime wedges
- Warm tortillas

**Asian version:**

- Quick cucumber salad (thinly slice cucumber, toss with rice vinegar, sesame oil, pinch sugar, salt)
- Stir-fried bok choy (halve lengthwise, pan-fry cut side down, add garlic and soy sauce)
- Kimchi
- Steamed edamame (boil 5 min in salted water)
- Rice
- Sesame seeds

**Curry version:**

- Basmati rice
- Store-bought naan
- Roasted cauliflower (toss florets with oil and curry powder, roast at 425°F for 25 min)
- Sautéed spinach (wilt in pan with garlic)
- Crispy chickpeas (drain, pat dry, toss with oil and spices, roast at 400°F for 30 min)

**American versions (Classic Diner, Veggie Western, Everything Bagel, Loaded Cheesy Herb):**

- Hash browns (shred potato, squeeze dry, pan-fry in oil until crispy)
- Home fries (cube potatoes, boil 5 min, pan-fry with onions until golden)
- Roasted breakfast potatoes (cube potatoes, toss with oil, herbs, salt; roast at 425°F for 30 min)
- Whole grain or sourdough toast
- Toasted bagel
- Sliced tomatoes and/or cucumbers
- Fresh fruit or fruit salad
- Simple arugula salad (toss with olive oil, lemon juice, salt)
- Mixed greens with lemon vinaigrette (whisk lemon juice, olive oil, Dijon, salt)
- Hot sauce
